---
// What this website keeps. It covers the site only: Pucksley, the product, is not on sale yet.
// Change `lastUpdated` whenever the page's meaning changes.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import { reader } from '../lib/content';

const site = await reader.singletons.siteSettings.read();
const email = site?.contactEmail ?? 'hello@nimblehive.com';
const lastUpdated = '18 November 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy: Pucksley" description="What the Pucksley website keeps: no cookies, no analytics, and one email address if you ask to hear when it is ready.">
  <Section surface="card" air="hero" id="top" wrapClass="narrow" class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>What this site keeps.</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      This website sets no cookies and loads no analytics. Its typeface, pictures and film are served from the site itself, so
      visiting it sends nothing to anyone else.
    </p>

    <h2>If you ask to hear when it is ready</h2>
    <p>
      We keep the email address you give us and the time you gave it, so that we can write to you when there is a puck you can have.
      It is kept in our own storage, not in a mailing-list service. We do not share it or sell it, and we do not use it for anything
      else.
    </p>
    <p>
      To have it removed, write to <a class="textlink" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> from that address and we will delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>The film</h2>
    <p>
      The film on this site is an ordinary video file. Nothing is fetched until you press play, and playing it is not recorded.
    </p>

    <h2>Pucksley itself</h2>
    <p>
      This page is about the website. Pucksley, the puck and its hub, is not on sale yet. When it is, this page will say what it keeps,
      where what you say to it goes, and what leaves your home.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Write to <a class="textlink" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</p>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
